Influenced by the hand-painted signs on cinema facades of the early cinema days, Lichtspielhaus Handmade comes with 4 weights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“Lichtspielhaus Handmade” is the second part of a Type Noir Quadrilogy.&lt;/p&gt;
